{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t本港三份報章分別由今日及明日起加價，其中明報今日起加價3元至15元一份，加幅為25%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n至於經濟及信報則明天起加價，經濟同樣由12元加至15元；信報則加價3元至18元一份。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:04.729426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:19:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:38.440162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:55.919122+00:00","content_hash":"ecf6395d653a3cd90932ba24b4b16be11d30f7f51591f748673f27d654685c16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}